Third-party assets and attributions:

* SF Pro typeface (referenced via the -apple-system fallback chain).
  Copyright (c) Apple Inc. Not bundled with this repository.
  Distributed by Apple at https://developer.apple.com/fonts/ under the Apple
  Color Emoji / SF Pro license. Renders natively on Apple hardware via the
  system fallback chain in colors_and_type.css; substituted by the system
  font on other platforms.

* SF Symbols. Copyright (c) Apple Inc. Not bundled. This bundle substitutes
  SF Symbols glyphs with Lucide (https://lucide.dev/, ISC License) per the
  iconography mapping in bundle/preview/iconography.html.

* Wallpapers in bundle/assets/wallpaper-*.png and bundle/assets/cover-bg.png.
  Copyright (c) Apple Inc. Sourced from the public "macOS 26 (Community).fig"
  file in the Apple Design Resources Figma Community. Used for design
  preview, prototyping, and mocks under fair use. Not redistributable as
  part of a shipped product — replace with your own asset before publishing
  an application that uses this bundle.

* The "macOS 26 (Community).fig" source file. Published by Apple via
  https://www.figma.com/@apple. Used to derive the design tokens and HTML
  specimens contained in this bundle. Apple Design Resources are provided
  by Apple for design exploration and prototyping; refer to Apple's terms
  for redistribution and commercial use.

* Lucide icons (https://lucide.dev/). Copyright (c) Lucide Contributors.
  ISC License. Used by reference only (loaded from the public unpkg CDN as
  documented in bundle/preview/iconography.html); not bundled.

* This bundle was wrapped as an Agent Skill via Claude Design at
  https://claude.ai/design and follows the Anthropic Agent Skills 2.0
  specification at
  https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agents-and-tools/agent-skills/overview.
